1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,500
When someone isn't right for you,

2
00:00:02,020 --> 00:00:04,120
life will keep using them to hurt you

3
00:00:04,120 --> 00:00:06,400
until you're strong enough to let go.

4
00:00:07,080 --> 00:00:08,640
And one day you'll realize

5
00:00:09,320 --> 00:00:11,000
they were only sent to teach you

6
00:00:11,000 --> 00:00:14,080
that losing someone is how you find yourself.
